SUMMARY:[Grant Radar] BJA FY 2026 Residential Substance Abuse Treatment (RSAT) for State Prisoners Formula Grants Program — due
DESCRIPTION:Formula money to every state for SUD treatment in prisons and jails (residential\, pretrial\, and aftercare tracks)\, with a required pass-through to local jails. 'Training curricula' is a listed allowable cost\, and MORE is an evidence-based treatment for OUD and co-occurring conditions that fits RSAT residential and aftercare programs as a training line item.\n\nPath: Line-item · Priority 2.0\nhttps://www.ojp.gov/funding/docs/bja-2026-172763.pdf
